adriantr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriantr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriantr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriantr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriantr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriantr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriantr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriantr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriantr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriantr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T10:42:22Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T10:42:22Z","body":"Huge +1 on this issue. We're in process of implementation of Spanner Graph, and are using Spanner emulator for testing as well as testing of flyway migrations.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/2801286572/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/2862089536","html_url":"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186#issuecomment-2862089536","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186","id":2862089536,"node_id":"IC_kwDODvxg1s6qmAVA","user":{"login":"svo","id":1498062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTgwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1498062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/svo","html_url":"https://github.com/svo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-08T07:42:52Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T07:42:52Z","body":"We’re working on a project that depends on Spanner Graph, which we’re finding valuable and enjoyable to work with. But without graph support in the emulator, local and CI/CD testing gets tricky, and we end up having to run everything directly against the cloud (making them slow and expensive).\n\nHaving graph support in the emulator would make testing smoother, faster, and much more cost-effective.\n\nWe’d love to see this prioritized and get some idea of when it might become available.\n\nAnything you can do to help would be greatly appreciated :pray:","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/2862089536/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/2862326589","html_url":"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186#issuecomment-2862326589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186","id":2862326589,"node_id":"IC_kwDODvxg1s6qm6M9","user":{"login":"apstndb","id":803393,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzM5Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/803393?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb","html_url":"https://github.com/apstndb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-08T09:10:37Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T09:17:29Z","body":"No one has mentioned it and I don't know the official status. But,\n\nhttps://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/releases/tag/v1.5.30\n> Add support for PropertyGraph (https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186)\n\nAfter this release `CREATE PROPERTY GRAPH` statement and `GRAPH` statement can be processed, but it seems that there are many unimplemented graph functions and some queries even stuck.\n\nhttps://cloud.google.com/spanner/docs/graph/queries-overview#quantified-path-patterns\n\n```\nspanner> GRAPH FinGraph\n      -> MATCH (n)\n      -> RETURN LABELS(n) AS label, n.id;\nERROR: spanner: code=\"Unimplemented\", desc: Unsupported built-in function: LABELS\n```\n\n```\nspanner> GRAPH FinGraph\n      -> MATCH (src:Account {id: 7})-[e:Transfers]->{1, 3}(dst:Account)\n      -> WHERE src != dst\n      -> RETURN src.id AS src_account_id, ARRAY_LENGTH(e) AS path_length, dst.id AS dst_account_id;\nERROR: spanner: code=\"Unimplemented\", desc: Unsupported comparison function: Equal with inputs TYPE_GRAPH_ELEMENT and TYPE_ARRAY\n```\n\n```\nspanner> GRAPH FinGraph\n      -> MATCH (n:Account {id: 7})\n      -> RETURN TO_JSON(n) AS n;\nERROR: spanner: code=\"InvalidArgument\", desc: No matching signature for function TO_JSON\n  Argument types: GRAPH_NODE(FinGraph)<create_time TIMESTAMP, id INT64, is_blocked BOOL, ...>\n  Signature: TO_JSON(T1, [stringify_wide_numbers => BOOL])\n    Argument 1: expected T1, found GRAPH_NODE(FinGraph)<create_time TIMESTAMP, id INT64, is_blocked BOOL, ...>: which is not allowed for ANY arguments [at 5:8]\nRETURN TO_JSON(n) AS n\n       ^\n```\n\nSome queries (including quantified bound pattern?) stucks.\n\nAdditionally, `GRAPH_TABLE` operator can't be used.\n\n```\nspanner> SELECT *\n         FROM GRAPH_TABLE(\n           FinGraph\n           MATCH (person:Person)\n           RETURN person.id AS person_id\n         );\nERROR: spanner: code=\"InvalidArgument\", desc: Syntax error: Expected \")\" or \",\" but got keyword MATCH [at 4:3]\n  MATCH (person:Person)\n  ^\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/2862326589/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/2884846140","html_url":"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186#issuecomment-2884846140","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186","id":2884846140,"node_id":"IC_kwDODvxg1s6r80I8","user":{"login":"smukil","id":8893250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4OTMyNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8893250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smukil","html_url":"https://github.com/smukil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smukil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smukil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smukil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smukil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smukil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smukil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smukil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smukil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smukil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T19:22:44Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T19:22:44Z","body":"Hi all,\n\nI was just pointed to the updates in this issue. (Note that I'm not a maintainer of the repo but have worked on adding PropertyGraph support to it). We have added PropertyGraph support as of v1.5.30.\n\n@apstndb Thank you for trying it out. `GRAPH_TABLE` support has just been added and will launch as part of the next release after which that should no longer be an issue.\n\nAdditionally, support for graph functions like LABELS(), PROPERTY_NAMES(), etc. are added, however, it does not work as of yet due to the dependency on ZetaSQL not being updated. The current version of zetaSQL it relies on is:\nhttps://github.com/google/zetasql/commit/a516c6b26d183efc4f56293256bba92e243b7a61\n\nAnd graph functions were added after that. Hence once the zetasql dependency is updated (which generally happens every 6 months or so based on the commit history and it seems like it's time for an update). Same goes for TO_JSON(<graph_element>).\n\nThe rest of graph support should be there, and you can look at tests within query_engine_test.cc for some starting examples:\nhttps://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/blob/cbce6641c962661ef6225377ca87910ba9b4d028/backend/query/query_engine_test.cc#L1605-L1677\n\nI will close this issue as resolved, and open another issue for updating zetasql dependencies for the sake of getting access to graph functions and exposing graph elements via JSON","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/2884846140/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/2989612454","html_url":"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186#issuecomment-2989612454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186","id":2989612454,"node_id":"IC_kwDODvxg1s6yMd2m","user":{"login":"apstndb","id":803393,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzM5Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/803393?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb","html_url":"https://github.com/apstndb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T02:17:17Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T02:17:17Z","body":"I've found that v1.5.35 seems to contain the undocumented fix of this issue via updated ZetaSQL.\n\nhttps://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/blame/e501b334ccd501b7bb8c8b6e18940e5ef80848ee/WORKSPACE#L340\n\n(I haven't yet tested this release because it is broken. #244)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/2989612454/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/3001440052","html_url":"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186#issuecomment-3001440052","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186","id":3001440052,"node_id":"IC_kwDODvxg1s6y5lc0","user":{"login":"apstndb","id":803393,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzM5Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/803393?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb","html_url":"https://github.com/apstndb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apstndb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T18:12:31Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T18:12:31Z","body":"I seems that many queries don't yet work in v1.5.36, except `GRAPH_TABLE`.\nhttps://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186#issuecomment-2862326589\n```\nspanner> GRAPH FinGraph\n         MATCH (n)\n         RETURN LABELS(n) AS label, n.id;\nERROR: spanner: code=\"Unimplemented\", desc: Unsupported built-in function: LABELS\nspanner> GRAPH FinGraph\n         MATCH (src:Account {id: 7})-[e:Transfers]->{1, 3}(dst:Account)\n         WHERE src != dst\n         RETURN src.id AS src_account_id, ARRAY_LENGTH(e) AS path_length, dst.id AS dst_account_id;\nERROR: spanner: code=\"Unimplemented\", desc: Unsupported comparison function: Equal with inputs TYPE_GRAPH_ELEMENT and TYPE_ARRAY\nspanner> GRAPH FinGraph\n         MATCH (n:Account {id: 7})\n         RETURN TO_JSON(n) AS n;\nERROR: spanner: code=\"InvalidArgument\", desc: No matching signature for function TO_JSON\n  Argument types: GRAPH_NODE(FinGraph)<create_time TIMESTAMP, id INT64, is_blocked BOOL, ...>\n  Signature: TO_JSON(T1, [stringify_wide_numbers => BOOL])\n    Argument 1: expected T1, found GRAPH_NODE(FinGraph)<create_time TIMESTAMP, id INT64, is_blocked BOOL, ...>: which is not allowed for ANY arguments [at 3:8]\nRETURN TO_JSON(n) AS n\n       ^\nspanner> SELECT *\n         FROM GRAPH_TABLE(\n           FinGraph\n           MATCH (person:Person)\n           RETURN person.id AS person_id\n         );\n+-----------+\n| person_id |\n+-----------+\n| 2         |\n| 1         |\n| 3         |\n+-----------+\n3 rows in set (3.423867ms)\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/3001440052/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/3179267284","html_url":"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186#issuecomment-3179267284","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/186","id":3179267284,"node_id":"IC_kwDODvxg1s69f8TU","user":{"login":"Silverhorse7","id":97148958,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcpgHg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97148958?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Silverhorse7","html_url":"https://github.com/Silverhorse7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Silverhorse7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Silverhorse7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Silverhorse7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Silverhorse7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Silverhorse7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Silverhorse7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Silverhorse7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Silverhorse7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Silverhorse7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T13:08:14Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T13:08:27Z","body":"Hi,\n\nCurrently, Spanner Graph allows using the same label for both a node and an edge which is a valid use case in our app. However, when testing this scenario on the emulator, I get the following error:\n\n```\nLabel TYPE_HAS_CHILD is only valid for nodes, but used here on a edge ...\n```\n\nIs there any plan for supporting this in the emulator?\n\nAdditionally, we have a case where we need to traverse with a length of 0 (so the starting node could also be the ending node). In the emulator, this results in:\n\n```\ngoogle.api_core.exceptions.MethodNotImplemented: 501 QuantifiedGraphPathOp for a lower bound of 0 is not yet implemented.\n```\n\nIs support for this scenario planned as well?\n\nThanks!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-spanner-emulator/issues/comments/3179267284/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]